  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Elaborate on the statement, 'The only true disability is the inability to accept and respect differences,' using examples or implications from the provided text.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$How does the narrative highlight the importance of individual influence in promoting inclusivity and changing community perspectives towards people with special needs?$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Examine the role of both sports and arts in Jamie's journey to transform his town's attitudes.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true),
  ('8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Discuss the challenges faced by people with special needs, as implied by the text, and how Jamie's efforts contributed to overcoming some of these challenges.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true);
INSERT INTO public.question_bank (id, institution_id, subject_id, topic_id, grade_level_id, class_group_id, question_text, question_type, options, correct_answer, marks, difficulty_level, tags, source, created_by, is_approved, parent_question_id, sub_question_count, sequence_order) VALUES
  ('00eb2684-5734-4cad-9d6e-21d360cd4fb1', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Born with a special need that confined him to a wheelchair, Jamie faced challenges from the very beginning. But within him burned a fierce determination and an unyielding spirit. As Jamie crossed the halls of his school, his mother’s words echoed in his mind. “You can achieve anything you focus on, Jamie,” she would say. But the taunts of his classmates made him doubt those words. “Hey, look! It’s Jamie, the kid in the wheelchair,” jeered a group of boys as Jamie wheeled past them. Ignoring the jibes, Jamie focussed on reaching his classroom. But their words stung, lasting long after the bell had rung.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('20ef71b1-e1ea-4e8c-ab26-1c0f17f0184b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$When a community centre opened its doors in the town, Jamie’s curiosity led him to discover a wheelchair basketball team practising inside. With grit and determination, he joined the team, finding a sense of belonging and purpose on the court. “You’ve got potential, kid,” Coach Miller said, giving Jamie a pat. “You could be one of the best with a little practice.” Encouraged by Coach Miller’s words, Jamie threw himself into the game, dribbling the ball with a newfound confidence. “You're a natural player, Jamie!” cheered his teammate, Sarah, as she passed him the ball. With each pass and each shot, Jamie felt a surge of pride, knowing that his particular needs didn’t define his abilities.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('ab72916b-f57f-4595-b2bb-95e210fc2029', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie, confined to a wheelchair from birth, faced daily challenges and the sting of classmates' taunts. His mother's constant affirmation, 'You can achieve anything you focus on, Jamie,' often battled against the doubts sown by others. One day, his curiosity led him to a community centre where he found a wheelchair basketball team. Despite his initial hesitations, he joined, driven by an 'unyielding spirit'. On the court, he received positive reinforcement from Coach Miller and teammate Sarah, which ignited a 'newfound confidence' and a 'surge of pride'. He realized that his 'particular needs didn’t define his abilities'.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('e932484d-c695-4d35-89d9-48bf5f249c98', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story 'Wheels Of Resilience' introduces Jamie, a differently-abled boy who, despite being confined to a wheelchair, possesses a fierce determination. He navigates school halls where he faces taunts from peers, making him doubt his mother's encouraging words. However, his journey takes a turn when he discovers a wheelchair basketball team at a community centre. Here, he finds not only a sport but also a supportive environment with figures like Coach Miller and teammate Sarah, who affirm his potential. This experience allows Jamie to develop a newfound confidence and a strong sense of purpose, ultimately realizing his abilities are not limited by his physical condition.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('85ac9127-efc2-47b3-b295-69b5ca84e416', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's initial school experience was marred by the taunts of his classmates, which deeply affected him despite his mother's empowering words. The phrase 'their words stung, lasting long after the bell had rung' highlights the emotional toll. However, Jamie's inherent curiosity led him to the community centre, where he observed a wheelchair basketball team. This observation sparked a decision to join, driven by 'grit and determination'. The positive feedback from Coach Miller and Sarah reinforced his potential, leading to a 'surge of pride' and a profound understanding that his physical condition did not dictate his capabilities.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('5d599e79-7948-4765-ace8-ebf6eeaefd81', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The narrative emphasizes the power of internal resolve and external support. Jamie's 'fierce determination' and 'unyielding spirit' were crucial in his journey. His mother's consistent affirmation, 'You can achieve anything you focus on,' provided a foundational belief. When faced with the negativity of his classmates, these internal and familial supports were tested. However, the discovery of the wheelchair basketball team and the subsequent positive reinforcement from Coach Miller and Sarah provided the necessary external validation, allowing Jamie to overcome doubt and embrace his potential, ultimately finding 'a sense of belonging and purpose'.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
