  ('9109dc12-9430-4355-a095-7ec9b5e63015', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's journey is a powerful narrative about overcoming perceived limitations. His 'special need' and confinement to a wheelchair were initially seen as defining characteristics, especially by his taunting classmates. However, through his 'fierce determination' and the supportive environment of the basketball team, he came to the profound realization that 'his particular needs didn’t define his abilities'. This shift in perspective is central to his resilience.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('b0fb7277-3c5a-4067-845f-2e0ff294a5a6', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie, initially known for his confidence on the basketball court, unexpectedly discovered a profound talent for art. This new pursuit, however, was met with initial skepticism from some members of the community who doubted his ability to create paintings while in a wheelchair. This early challenge highlighted the societal barriers he faced.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('4f5d8cc5-0aac-4f7c-82eb-7eae9dd77a42', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$A particularly disheartening moment occurred when a passerby, eyeing Jamie's latest painting, jeered, 'I don't see why you bother.' Despite this scornful remark, Jamie's spirit remained unbroken. He simply smiled and continued to paint, completely absorbed in the vibrant world of colours and shapes before him, demonstrating remarkable resilience.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('95acc70d-f1b4-408e-82f9-5bb58a250f2b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Emily, a fellow artist, provided crucial encouragement to Jamie. She stopped to admire his work and genuinely remarked, 'You're really talented, Jamie. Don't let anyone tell you otherwise.' This positive affirmation significantly boosted Jamie's self-assurance, causing his confidence in his artistry to soar.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('c45f52ac-5922-4380-b8b9-7abc3a195640', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Even with growing success and external validation, Jamie still encountered moments of self-doubt and uncertainty. To navigate these internal struggles, he sought guidance from a mentor named David. David was uniquely positioned to help, as he was also differently-abled but had thrived in his own professional field.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('deba9765-6327-4c28-a5ea-a34c09593301', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$David's mentorship was characterized by powerful words of conviction. He told Jamie, 'You've got to believe in yourself, Jamie. You're capable of more than you know.' These words resonated deeply, echoing in Jamie's mind and empowering him to push through challenges, determined to prove his worth not only to others but also to himself.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('701adc45-a600-495e-bd9c-e5f9e794a6ac', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Empowered by his personal journey of overcoming obstacles and embracing his talent, Jamie embarked on a new mission. He decided to encourage other individuals with disabilities within his community, transforming his personal triumph into a broader social initiative aimed at fostering collective empowerment.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f7e98db4-9eda-4e2f-bd8a-013fb5d3d53c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$To achieve his mission, Jamie organized a variety of community-based activities. These included workshops, support groups, and awareness campaigns, all hosted at the local community centre. The overarching goal of these initiatives was to promote a culture of inclusivity and acceptance for people with disabilities.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('2fdd62eb-7fd7-43d3-a83c-ef056e4e93c3', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's efforts had a tangible impact, particularly on a young girl in a wheelchair. Her eyes shone with gratitude as she told Jamie, 'I never thought I could do anything like this until I met you.' This interaction underscored the profound inspirational effect Jamie had on individuals facing similar challenges.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('d1475ac7-1848-43ae-9ab7-d8b35398ccef', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$In a heartwarming gesture, Jamie wheeled beside the young girl and offered his hand in friendship. His voice, filled with hope, declared, 'Together, we can accomplish anything.' This statement encapsulated his belief in collective strength and mutual support as key to overcoming adversity.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
