  ('47f895f8-6441-4ddc-9f7a-ba0f08bdba6c', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie learned to navigate the 'highs and lows of his journey with grace and resilience.' This indicates that his path was not always smooth; he faced both triumphs and setbacks. His ability to handle these varied experiences with composure and strength was a testament to his personal growth and inner fortitude.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('855f63f6-e320-4e40-b6e2-9d2d03710cac', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's workshops and support groups at the community centre were designed to be interactive and empowering. While the specific content isn't detailed, it can be inferred that they focused on fostering self-belief, teaching adaptive skills, and building a supportive network for individuals with disabilities, using art as a potential medium or inspiration.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('45e7cc8b-b9ce-4b91-95fa-b4600618085a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The fact that Jamie's mentor, David, was 'himself differently-abled but thriving in his field' is highly significant. This shared experience created a unique bond and credibility, allowing David to offer guidance that was not only empathetic but also deeply informed by personal understanding of similar challenges.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('1d80d3bf-14d7-40dd-ab76-d210be3d17b6', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The young girl's statement, 'I never thought I could do anything like this until I met you,' powerfully illustrates Jamie's transformative impact. Her words signify a shift from perceived limitations and self-doubt to a newfound sense of possibility and empowerment, directly inspired by Jamie's example and encouragement.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('7b394a3e-24b4-4ae0-a8ab-5b38d0c0e2cb', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's determination to 'prove his worth to others and himself' highlights a dual motivation. While external validation might have played a role, the emphasis on proving it to 'himself' suggests a deeper, intrinsic drive for self-acceptance and affirmation of his capabilities, independent of external opinions.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
