  ('114ef114-ed0f-449e-b2dc-87cb04995654', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The phrase 'lost in the world of colours and shapes unfolding before him' vividly describes Jamie's deep immersion in his artistic process. It conveys a state of flow and intense concentration, where external distractions and negative comments fade away, allowing pure creative expression to dominate.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('0afac471-78f6-4aa6-808a-c1a6e76c58ad', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's mission to promote a 'culture of inclusivity and acceptance' involved actively breaking down barriers and fostering an environment where all individuals, regardless of ability, felt valued and belonged. This went beyond mere tolerance, aiming for genuine integration and mutual respect within the community.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('391851c7-3f83-423b-b5f6-3b6320d9d636', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$When Jamie offered the young girl his hand in friendship, it was a powerful symbolic gesture. It represented not just personal connection but also an invitation to join a supportive community, reinforcing his message that 'Together, we can accomplish anything' through solidarity and shared purpose.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('44d30f7c-c981-47d8-abb6-9d2f971647e4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's voice, 'filled with hope,' when he spoke of collective accomplishment, underscores the optimistic and forward-looking nature of his leadership. This hope was not naive but rooted in his own journey of overcoming adversity and witnessing the positive impact of support and self-belief.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('ef54c768-4002-4d28-8270-fcbb20649bfd', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$As time passed, Jamie’s influence on his town became undeniable. His achievements in sports and arts, combined with his promotion activity brought about significant changes in the attitudes of the town towards people with special needs. 'You've changed this town, Jamie,' Mayor Thompson said, shaking his hand firmly. 'We're proud to call you one of our own.' With tears of joy in his eyes, Jamie looked out at the faces gathered before him, each one proof of the power of resilience and hope. Resilience is the art of bouncing back stronger, no matter how hard the challenges are. The only true disability is the inability to accept and respect differences. People with special needs sometimes feel left out when they encounter physical barriers in public places.$qbx$, 'long_answer'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 6, NULL),
  ('1e2d8b40-bf9e-4de0-a21f-eb529cd1c030', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Born with a special need that confined him to a wheelchair, Jamie faced challenges from the very beginning. But within him burned a fierce determination and an unyielding spirit. As Jamie crossed the halls of his school, his mother’s words echoed in his mind. “You can achieve anything you focus on, Jamie,” she would say. But the taunts of his classmates made him doubt those words. “Hey, look! It’s Jamie, the kid in the wheelchair,” jeered a group of boys as Jamie wheeled past them. Ignoring the jibes, Jamie focussed on reaching his classroom. But their words stung, lasting long after the bell had rung.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('ff355683-0b68-4016-b6a7-659be773129f', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$When a community centre opened its doors in the town, Jamie’s curiosity led him to discover a wheelchair basketball team practising inside. With grit and determination, he joined the team, finding a sense of belonging and purpose on the court. “You’ve got potential, kid,” Coach Miller said, giving Jamie a pat. “You could be one of the best with a little practice.” Encouraged by Coach Miller’s words, Jamie threw himself into the game, dribbling the ball with a newfound confidence. “You're a natural player, Jamie!” cheered his teammate, Sarah, as she passed him the ball. With each pass and each shot, Jamie felt a surge of pride, knowing that his particular needs didn’t define his abilities.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('4abd0384-0eb4-429d-96f7-fa628f4b779a', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$This is a story about a differently-abled boy whose determination and actions have led to a significant influence on his community. Let’s read the story to learn more about his journey. The lesson also aims for students to read the text with correct pronunciation, intonation and expressions, explore and appreciate the theme, learn new words and use them in sentences, answer questions based on the story, use future tenses correctly in sentences, and write a newspaper report.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('44d473e9-3844-4854-9724-9accdbc96b31', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Born with a special need that confined him to a wheelchair, Jamie faced challenges from the very beginning. But within him burned a fierce determination and an unyielding spirit. As Jamie crossed the halls of his school, his mother’s words echoed in his mind. “You can achieve anything you focus on, Jamie,” she would say. But the taunts of his classmates made him doubt those words. “Hey, look! It’s Jamie, the kid in the wheelchair,” jeered a group of boys as Jamie wheeled past them. Ignoring the jibes, Jamie focussed on reaching his classroom. But their words stung, lasting long after the bell had rung.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f03bbbc3-fb96-4611-b6a4-815b532a0789', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$When a community centre opened its doors in the town, Jamie’s curiosity led him to discover a wheelchair basketball team practising inside. With grit and determination, he joined the team, finding a sense of belonging and purpose on the court. “You’ve got potential, kid,” Coach Miller said, giving Jamie a pat. “You could be one of the best with a little practice.” Encouraged by Coach Miller’s words, Jamie threw himself into the game, dribbling the ball with a newfound confidence. “You're a natural player, Jamie!” cheered his teammate, Sarah, as she passed him the ball. With each pass and each shot, Jamie felt a surge of pride, knowing that his particular needs didn’t define his abilities.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f121a5b7-8fc5-4401-9739-b8993f6928cc', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie, a differently-abled boy, possessed a fierce determination and an unyielding spirit. Despite being confined to a wheelchair and facing taunts from classmates, his mother's words, 'You can achieve anything you focus on,' resonated with him. His journey took a positive turn when he discovered a wheelchair basketball team at a community centre, where he found belonging and purpose. Encouragement from Coach Miller and teammate Sarah further boosted his confidence, leading him to realize that his special needs did not define his abilities.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('2d189571-68f4-438a-a270-0b7f28350e46', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story 'Wheels Of Resilience' highlights the importance of supportive friends, family, and mentors in achieving goals. Jamie's mother provided initial encouragement, while Coach Miller and teammate Sarah offered crucial support on the basketball court. These positive influences helped Jamie overcome the negative impact of his classmates' taunts and develop a strong sense of self-worth and capability.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('5e8246ac-a4db-41cd-92e0-084544975cca', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's initial experience in school was challenging, as the 'taunts of his classmates made him doubt' his mother's empowering words. He chose to ignore the 'jibes' and focus on reaching his classroom, but the words 'stung, lasting long after the bell had rung.' This shows the deep emotional impact of negative peer interactions.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('394d2482-edb4-4483-bfea-445c6bf13fd1', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's curiosity led him to the community centre, where he found a wheelchair basketball team. This discovery was pivotal. He joined the team 'with grit and determination,' which allowed him to find 'a sense of belonging and purpose on the court.' This active engagement transformed his outlook.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('f08bd581-af00-49ab-95a0-f0b9f730f77e', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Coach Miller's words, 'You’ve got potential, kid... You could be one of the best with a little practice,' were highly encouraging. Similarly, Sarah's cheer, 'You're a natural player, Jamie!' provided strong affirmation. These positive reinforcements were instrumental in Jamie's development of 'newfound confidence' and a 'surge of pride' in his abilities.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('490aecef-39c2-48a0-8de9-64b4fa16c9a9', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story emphasizes that Jamie's 'particular needs didn’t define his abilities.' This realization was a culmination of his experiences on the basketball court, where he found success and acceptance. It signifies a profound shift in his self-perception, moving beyond the limitations imposed by his physical condition and the negative perceptions of others.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('9b28368e-83b7-4c9d-acb7-17a5bc102198', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The learning outcomes for the lesson include developing reading skills such as correct pronunciation, intonation, and expressions. Students are also expected to expand their vocabulary by learning new words and using them in sentences. Furthermore, the lesson aims to improve grammar by correctly using future tenses and to develop writing skills through composing a newspaper report.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('dbb52186-1be2-47b8-bb68-e77ac039df90', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's journey is presented as a story of a 'differently-abled boy whose determination and actions have led to a significant influence on his community.' This suggests that his personal triumph over adversity has a broader societal impact, potentially inspiring others and fostering a more inclusive environment.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('84d884b2-ff8d-472b-bb15-59199d613b21', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's mother's words, 'You can achieve anything you focus on, Jamie,' were a powerful source of motivation. However, the 'taunts of his classmates' created doubt. This highlights the ongoing battle between internal belief and external negativity, a common human experience that Jamie had to navigate.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('18f505df-9070-43fd-8198-87afe7891f13', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's 'fierce determination and an unyielding spirit' were crucial internal strengths. These qualities allowed him to 'ignore the jibes' of his classmates and later to join the basketball team 'with grit and determination.' These internal attributes were fundamental to his resilience.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('d76b740c-6b27-45cd-a394-cd95987654a4', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The community centre provided Jamie with a new environment that fostered positive growth. Unlike his school experience, where he faced taunts, the centre offered a space for 'belonging and purpose.' This shift in environment was essential for his emotional and personal development.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('340214f0-b1cf-4ccd-9694-51266cc7a011', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Coach Miller's assessment, 'You’ve got potential, kid,' and Sarah's enthusiastic cheer, 'You're a natural player, Jamie!' were more than just compliments. They were affirmations that validated Jamie's efforts and talent. This validation was critical for him to develop 'newfound confidence' and a 'surge of pride,' reinforcing his belief in his own abilities.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('38542174-8485-4133-8951-227fe020f058', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's decision to throw 'himself into the game, dribbling the ball with a newfound confidence,' demonstrates his active engagement and commitment. This active participation, fueled by encouragement, allowed him to experience success and internalize the belief that his 'particular needs didn’t define his abilities.'$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('e3a1c077-1740-4a2a-8896-1909bdf94b4b', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The story's title, 'Wheels Of Resilience,' encapsulates its core message. 'Wheels' refers to Jamie's physical condition, while 'Resilience' signifies his ability to overcome adversity. Together, they represent his journey of strength and perseverance despite challenges, ultimately leading to personal triumph and influence on his community.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('4c25fbcb-0651-4efa-94fe-02a43f2c58ae', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$The lesson's pre-reading section asks, 'What role do supportive friends, family and mentors play in helping us achieve our goals?' and 'Who is your most supportive friend or family member?' These questions encourage reflection on the very themes explored in Jamie's story, connecting the narrative to students' personal experiences.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('dfdf3d53-ca1c-4d71-9fe9-2606931bbc48', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's initial doubt, caused by the taunts of his classmates, was a significant hurdle. However, his mother's consistent message, 'You can achieve anything you focus on,' provided a counter-narrative. This internal struggle between doubt and belief was a key part of his early development, shaping his determination to prove himself.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('6ad04a4b-5f0a-4df0-ba06-ff1ce170544d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's 'curiosity' was a driving force. It led him to explore the community centre, which in turn led to the discovery of the wheelchair basketball team. Without this initial curiosity, he might not have found the opportunity that transformed his life, highlighting the importance of an inquisitive mind.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('8f38ac79-5480-461f-8da5-a70ef5887d0d', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$On the basketball court, Jamie experienced 'a sense of belonging and purpose.' This was a stark contrast to his feelings of isolation and being targeted at school. This new environment provided him with a community where he was valued for his abilities, not judged for his differences.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('4be873e6-1351-472b-9c69-fe303ec53bcf', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$Jamie's realization that 'his particular needs didn’t define his abilities' is a powerful message of empowerment. It signifies a shift from a deficit-based view of himself to an asset-based view, where his strengths and potential are recognized, regardless of his physical condition. This self-acceptance is a cornerstone of his resilience.$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 4, NULL),
  ('a24967e3-baee-40bc-a596-1323317b2522', '8af718c6-ca11-482b-9d6b-832f2b767928', '309ba1a2-eec4-402c-9562-5fe99e4431be', '06451e70-3f92-45d7-b3ca-febb0d493d17', 'cf2d9caa-5ae4-46df-9954-b637993032da', '95b8bc81-1f6b-4a5c-845b-a3afb375fa3a', $qbx$As Jamie’s confidence grew on the basketball court, he also discovered a hidden talent for art. Despite initial scepticism from some in the community about his ability to create paintings sitting in his wheelchair, Jamie’s passion and creativity knew no bounds. “I don’t see why you bother,” jeered a passerby, eyeing Jamie’s latest painting with a scorn. Do you think the passerby’s attitude will affect Jamie’s confidence? But Jamie smiled and continued to paint, lost in the world of colours and shapes unfolding before him. “You're really talented, Jamie,” remarked Emily, a fellow artist who had stopped to admire his work. “Don’t let anyone tell you otherwise.” With Emily’s encouragement, Jamie’s confidence in his artistry soared, each brushstroke proof of his spirit and determination. Despite his success, Jamie faced moments of self-doubt and uncertainty. With the guidance of a mentor, himself differently- abled but thriving in his field, Jamie learnt to navigate the highs and lows of his journey with grace and resilience. “You've got to believe in yourself, Jamie,” his mentor, David, said, his voice filled with conviction. “You're capable of more than you know.” With David’s words echoing in his mind, Jamie pushed through the challenges, determined to prove his worth to others and himself. Empowered by his journey, Jamie began a mission to encourage others with disabilities in his community. He organised workshops, support groups and awareness campaigns at the community centre, promoting a culture of inclusivity and acceptance. “Thank you, Jamie,” said a young girl in a wheelchair, her eyes shining with gratitude. “I never thought | could do anything like this until | met you.” With a smile, Jamie wheeled beside her, offering his hand in friendship. “Together, we can accomplish anything,” he said, his voice filled with hope. English-8$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
