ing his hand in friendship. “Together, we can accomplish anything,” he said, his voice filled with hope. English-8$qbx$, 'comprehension'::question_type, NULL, NULL, 1, 5, ARRAY[]::text[], 'ai_xlsx_import_xlsx_2026-06-08T09-55-14-076Z', 'ba219b8a-c17f-46af-b642-be52f18c80ff', true, NULL, 1, NULL),
